=============================================================
CONTROLS: non-Keller.  The detector must SEE degree and tears.
=============================================================
-------------------------------------------------------------
(x, y^2)     proper, 2 sheets
   det J                    =  2*y
   geometric degree  vdim   =  2
   Groebner basis / Q(a,b)  =  G[1]=x+(-a)
G[2]=y2+(-b)
   leading coefficients:
         1
         1
   ==> all leading coefficients constant: PROPER
-------------------------------------------------------------
(x, y^3-3xy) proper, 3 sheets
   det J                    =  3*y2-3*x
   geometric degree  vdim   =  3
   Groebner basis / Q(a,b)  =  G[1]=x+(-a)
G[2]=y3-3*xy+(-b)
   leading coefficients:
         1
         1
   ==> all leading coefficients constant: PROPER
-------------------------------------------------------------
(x, xy)      TEAR
   det J                    =  x
   geometric degree  vdim   =  1
   Groebner basis / Q(a,b)  =  G[1]=(a)*y+(-b)
G[2]=x+(-a)
   leading coefficients:
         (a)
         1
   ==> NON-CONSTANT leading coefficient: THE FIBRE TEARS
-------------------------------------------------------------
(y, xy+x)    TEAR
   det J                    =  -y-1
   geometric degree  vdim   =  1
   Groebner basis / Q(a,b)  =  G[1]=y+(-a)
G[2]=(a+1)*x+(-b)
   leading coefficients:
         1
         (a+1)
   ==> NON-CONSTANT leading coefficient: THE FIBRE TEARS
-------------------------------------------------------------
(x^2y+x, y)  2 SHEETS + TEAR
   det J                    =  2*xy+1
   geometric degree  vdim   =  2
   Groebner basis / Q(a,b)  =  G[1]=y+(-b)
G[2]=(b)*x2+x+(-a)
   leading coefficients:
         1
         (b)
   ==> NON-CONSTANT leading coefficient: THE FIBRE TEARS
   ==> d >= 2 with a tear: COUNTEREXAMPLE PROFILE

=============================================================
The last control carries the full counterexample profile -
geometric degree 2 together with a tear at b = 0 - and fails
only because det J = 2xy+1 is not constant.  The detector is
therefore live: it does not return 'automorphism' by fiat.
=============================================================
